    "phase_in_months": 0,
    "quote": "Manufacturers must report any battery-related fire, thermal runaway, explosion, or injury requiring medical treatment to the relevant regulator within 24 hours of learning of it. Other confirmed thermal incidents, including overheating without fire or injury, must be reported within 5 business days."
   },
